<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Corny Inc.</title>
<meta name="description" content="Corny Inc. — fresh ideas, golden results. Visit us at cornyinc.com.">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fredoka:wght@500;700&family=Inter:wght@400;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  /* All styles are scoped to .corny so this can be pasted into a site builder embed block safely */
  .corny {
    --gold: #f5b700;
    --gold-dark: #d99a00;
    --husk: #4f7d2c;
    --husk-dark: #2f4f1a;
    --cream: #fff9e8;
    --ink: #2b2410;
    --muted: #6b6250;
    font-family: "Inter", system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
    color: var(--ink);
    background: var(--cream);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .corny * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  .corny h1, .corny h2, .corny h3 { font-family: "Fredoka", "Inter", sans-serif; line-height: 1.15; margin: 0 0 .5em; }
  .corny a { color: inherit; }
  .corny .wrap { max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 20px; }

  /* Nav */
  .corny nav { background: var(--husk-dark); color: #fff; position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 10; }
  .corny nav .wrap { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; height: 64px; gap: 16px; }
  .corny .logo { font-family: "Fredoka", sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.5rem; text-decoration: none; color: var(--gold); }
  .corny .logo span { color: #fff; }
  .corny nav ul { list-style: none; display: flex; gap: 24px; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  .corny nav ul a { text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; opacity: .9; }
  .corny nav ul a:hover { color: var(--gold); opacity: 1; }

  /* Hero */
  .corny .hero {
    background: linear-gradient(160deg, var(--gold) 0%, #ffd54a 60%, var(--cream) 100%);
    padding: 96px 0 80px; text-align: center;
  }
  .corny .hero .emoji { font-size: 4rem; display: block; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .corny .hero h1 { font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 6vw, 4rem); color: var(--husk-dark); }
  .corny .hero p { font-size: 1.2rem; max-width: 620px; margin: 0 auto 32px; color: var(--ink); }
  .corny .btn {
    display: inline-block; padding: 14px 30px; border-radius: 999px; font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: none; transition: transform .15s, background .15s; border: 0; cursor: pointer; font-size: 1rem;
  }
  .corny .btn-primary { background: var(--husk-dark); color: #fff; }
  .corny .btn-primary:hover { background: var(--husk); transform: translateY(-2px); }
  .corny .btn-ghost { border: 2px solid var(--husk-dark); color: var(--husk-dark); margin-left: 10px; }
  .corny .btn-ghost:hover { background: rgba(47,79,26,.08); }

  /* Sections */
  .corny section { padding: 80px 0; }
  .corny .section-title { text-align: center; font-size: 2.2rem; color: var(--husk-dark); }
  .corny .section-sub { text-align: center; color: var(--muted); max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto 48px; }

  .corny .grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 24px; }
  .corny .card {
    background: #fff; border-radius: 18px; padding: 32px 26px;
    box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(79,60,0,.08); border-top: 6px solid var(--gold);
    transition: transform .2s;
  }
  .corny .card:hover { transform: translateY(-4px); }
  .corny .card .icon { font-size: 2.2rem; }
  .corny .card h3 { margin-top: 12px; color: var(--husk-dark); }
  .corny .card p { color: var(--muted); margin: 0; }

  /* About */
  .corny .about { background: #fff; }
  .corny .about .wrap { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 48px; align-items: center; }
  .corny .about .art {
    background: var(--gold); border-radius: 24px; aspect-ratio: 1/1; display: flex;
    align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 8rem;
  }
  .corny .stats { display: flex; gap: 32px; margin-top: 24px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .corny .stats strong { display: block; font-family: "Fredoka", sans-serif; font-size: 2rem; color: var(--gold-dark); }

  /* Contact */
  .corny .contact form { max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto; display: grid; gap: 14px; }
  .corny .contact input, .corny .contact textarea {
    width: 100%; padding: 14px 16px; border-radius: 12px; border: 2px solid #eadfbf;
    font: inherit; background: #fff;
  }
  .corny .contact input:focus, .corny .contact textarea:focus { outline: none; border-color: var(--gold); }
  .corny .contact .btn { justify-self: center; }

  /* Footer */
  .corny footer { background: var(--husk-dark); color: #e9e3cf; padding: 32px 0; text-align: center; font-size: .95rem; }
  .corny footer a { color: var(--gold); text-decoration: none; }

  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .corny nav ul { display: none; }
    .corny .about .wrap { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .corny .btn-ghost { margin: 12px 0 0; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body class="corny">

<nav>
  <div class="wrap">
    <a href="https://cornyinc.com" class="logo">Corny<span> Inc.</span></a>
    <ul>
      <li><a href="#services">What We Do</a></li>
      <li><a href="#about">About</a></li>
      <li><a href="#contact">Contact</a></li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</nav>

<header class="hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <span class="emoji">🌽</span>
    <h1>Welcome to Corny Inc.</h1>
    <p>Fresh ideas, golden results. We bring a kernel of fun to everything we do.</p>
    <a href="#services" class="btn btn-primary">See What We Do</a>
    <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-ghost">Get in Touch</a>
  </div>
</header>

<section id="services">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2 class="section-title">What We Do</h2>
    <p class="section-sub">Replace these with your real products or services.</p>
    <div class="grid">
      <div class="card">
        <div class="icon">🌱</div>
        <h3>Service One</h3>
        <p>A short description of your first product or service and why people love it.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="icon">🍿</div>
        <h3>Service Two</h3>
        <p>A short description of your second product or service and what makes it pop.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="icon">🚜</div>
        <h3>Service Three</h3>
        <p>A short description of your third product or service and how it helps customers.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="about" class="about">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="art" aria-hidden="true">🌽</div>
    <div>
      <h2 class="section-title" style="text-align:left">About Corny Inc.</h2>
      <p>Corny Inc. started with a simple idea: work should be good, and it should be fun. Tell your story here — when you started, who you serve, and what makes you different.</p>
      <div class="stats">
        <div><strong>100+</strong>Happy customers</div>
        <div><strong>5★</strong>Average rating</div>
        <div><strong>2026</strong>Est.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="contact" class="contact">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2 class="section-title">Contact Us</h2>
    <p class="section-sub">Have a question or want to work with us? Send us a message.</p>
    <!-- Replace the action below with your form service (e.g. Formspree) or a mailto: address -->
    <form action="mailto:hello@cornyinc.com" method="post" enctype="text/plain">
      <input type="text" name="name" placeholder="Your name" required>
      <input type="email" name="email" placeholder="Your email" required>
      <textarea name="message" rows="5" placeholder="Your message" required></textarea>
      <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary">Send Message</button>
    </form>
  </div>
</section>

<footer>
  <div class="wrap">
    <p>© <span id="corny-year">2026</span> Corny Inc. · <a href="https://cornyinc.com">cornyinc.com</a></p>
  </div>
</footer>

<script>
  document.getElementById("corny-year").textContent = new Date().getFullYear();
</script>
</body>
</html>
